			"notes": "Restores Sorted controls on backpack crafting screens: backpack buttons sit above the main panel at its right edge, search sits below at the far left, and the remaining player actions sit below at the far right. Placement matches the original plain backpack, including larger configured sizes.\n\nSorting, stacking, filtering and cursor-recovery destinations exclude the separate backpack crafting grid and output. Original Sorted and other developer JARs remain unchanged.\n\nVerified the exact release candidate with 27-, 78- and 117-slot backpacks, both crafting grids, Sorted 0.1.25/0.1.26, native/Polymer profiles, recipe-book/Pins interactions, Hotkey Wheel and disposable client/server installers. Detailed evidence and test limits are in the included documentation.\n\nMinecraft 26.3, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+, Java 25. Use the installation ZIP for the exact dependency set; Fzzy Config remains an official manifest download."
