			"notes": "Backpack crafting is now included in the suite with final `iron_toolbox` and `netherite_toolbox` IDs. Iron enables 2×2 crafting; the smithing-table netherite upgrade enables 3×3. Both use a compact floating panel and a recipe book that draws ingredients from player and backpack storage. Original developer backpack/pouch JARs remain unchanged.\n\nVerified: 198 server checks each in native/Polymer profiles, four connection profiles, eight crafting cases each with published/local BRBR, current Hotkey Wheel in native/Polymer profiles, and actual client/server installation checks. Exact hashes, profiles and limits are in [the release guide](https://github.com/THENATHE/vanilla-plusplus-quality-of-life-suite/blob/v1.4.0+26.3/docs/RELEASE_1_4_0.md).\n\nUse the suite JAR with the required libraries, or the installation ZIP. Fzzy Config remains an official manifest download; the installer needs internet for it."
